The '''western spaceport''' was a [[spaceport]] in the [[Port District (Coruscant)|Port District]] of the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]]. During the [[Separatist Crisis]], it experienced, along with the [[Coruscant Eastern Spaceport|Eastport]], a 6,000% increase in migration traffic. During this period, [[Galactic Republic]] [[Senator]] [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]] and [[Padawan|Jedi Padawan]] [[Anakin Skywalker]] boarded the [[AA-9 Freighter-Liner]] ''[[Jendirian Valley]]'' to [[Naboo]].<ref name="Coruscant" />

